// Syncthing allowlist — sync ONLY the MOI layer of this workspace.
// Codebases and repos (agents/, ai-agent-eva/, dotfiles/, ...) sync via
// their own git remotes and must never travel through Syncthing.
// First match wins: machine-generated dirs first, then includes, then
// ignore everything else.

// machine-generated, regenerated by bun install / moi bundle
(?d)/.moi-objects/*/node_modules
(?d)/.moi-objects/*/.build
(?d)/.moi-objects/*/.cache

// dolt lock files must stay per-machine
/.beads-remotes/*/LOCK

// the MOI layer, beads dolt remotes, + workspace metadata
!/.moi-objects
!/.moi-objects/**
!/.beads-remotes
!/.beads-remotes/**
!/README.md
!/.gitignore

// everything else stays local (incl. child repos and the parent .git)
*
